{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>當生活節奏過於嘈雜，Breathe Relief 能協助您暫停腳步並調整呼吸。這款應用適合追求內心平靜或需要快速舒緩壓力的用戶，現正限時免費下載。它提供基於證據引導的簡短重置練習，無需註冊帳號即可使用，讓您在繁忙日常中找回片刻寧靜。</p>\n\n<h2>個人化隱私保護與智能引導</h2>\n<p>用戶可根據需求選擇不同模式，搭配聲音、觸覺反饋及語音指導進行練習。所有檢查記錄與呼吸歷史均存於本地裝置，確保數據隱私安全。透過觀察哪些方法最有效，使用者能逐步建立專屬的減壓習慣。這是一款注重私隱的一般健康工具，並非醫療產品，旨在為大眾提供方便的身心調節輔助，幫助用戶在壓力下保持冷靜與專注。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-17-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-18-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-19-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Breathe Relief</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T09:59:31.738995+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}